cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these certificates or this code, please cite them as below."
title: "Certified upper bounds in Turán's pure power sum problem (Erdős #519)"
abstract: >-
  Explicit n-tuples of complex numbers, stored as exact certificates, giving
  rigorous upper bounds for R_n in Turán's pure power sum problem for 13 values
  of n between 300 and 1000000, with two independent checkers (ball arithmetic
  and exact integer arithmetic). Not peer reviewed; made with substantial help
  from AI models (Claude Opus 5.5 and Claude Sonnet 5.5, Anthropic).
authors:
